    "Candidate-first then stable on one emulator; no counterbalancing or repeated samples. Emulator warm-up, caches, host load and recording overhead may confound comparisons.",
    "Recorded and nominal 3D-unrecorded candidate profiles finish in automatic lightweight mode; their percentile improvements cannot be presented as sustained equivalent-quality GL improvement.",
    "Explicit lightweight candidate profile regresses from P95 85 to 133 ms and PSS-after 115030 to 128585 KiB. Candidate profiles report every sampled UI frame janky; near 60 FPS is not established.",
